   166	protocol hooks. Every instance proves `HooksSound P`:
   167	- `excludes` is stable under `clock`, `process` and `recordOwn`, and
   168	  implies that `process` leaves the state unchanged;
   169	- `processed` and `depsPresent` are monotone (`processed` may be derived,
   170	  as in SA-PC's `processed(pc)`);
