   234	```lean
   235	structure Instance where
   236	  P       : ProtocolSpec
   237	  facets  : FacetBundle P     -- every facet the instance exposes, once
   238	  params  : ParamBinding      -- one value per named parameter
   239	  hooks   : HooksSound P
