   172	- **handler link** (audit B03): after the delivery of `o` in a state where
   173	  `handles o o'`, either `processed o'` holds, or `excludes o'` holds, or
   174	  `depsPresent o'` is false;
   175	- **honest deliverability** (audit B03): every object that an honest node
   176	  emits has its dependencies emitted by honest nodes at earlier or equal
   177	  times, or carried inside it. So the canonical synchronous scheduler can
   178	  always deliver it.
