   177	timeout row. Its named entry `T=σ[C].T_h⪯C` inherits them.
   178	
   179	“HEAD from q_s” refers to emitted HEAD duties. It does not assert that
   180	an arbitrary full-view recomputation between duties is an emission.
   181	“By +10Δ” is subject to the horizon and `t≥+10Δ` guards just stated.
   182	
   183	**Release, including equality.** Let p be the surviving early support
   184	of C at the source reader's gate. Freshness gives `p≥τ` and the strict
   185	late-denominator majority. By forward relay, these p complete HEADs
   186	are resolved at every honest release snapshot at q_s. If a second
