   532	compatible.
   533	
   534	Proof. If s1 = s2, both are prefixes of label-s1 genuine results; B1
   535	applies. If s1 < s2, then `q(B1) = v_(s1+1) ≤ v_(s2) < t`. By IH(t)(i),
