    94	**A justification can be stored forever, but it is not a PC. — PROVED**
    95	
    96	A TA PC contains q next-label acknowledgements. Each honest acknowledgement
    97	attests to a resolved exact quorum saved before the previous early cutoff,
    98	and its carried HEAD extends that target. This supplies a causal transfer
    99	argument. A raw FFG link contains Q source/target votes. It supplies neither
   100	that receipt deadline nor that HEAD-extension fact. Equal quorum sizes do
   101	not make the certificates interchangeable.
   102	
   103	PCs are not unconditional permanent roots either. SA-PC gives a live finite
   104	lease priority over the PC. In active mode, a supported F4 floor can defeat
   105	a conflicting PC. An ancestor floor retains the deeper PC. The PC remains
   106	stored and can veto a conflicting S write. Sound arming, rather than mere
   107	possession after a partition, gives its unbounded persistence theorem.
   108	
   109	Ordinary FFG does not logically require PC checkpoints for its certificate
   110	safety theorem. It requires justified sources, descendant targets, quorum
   111	links, and authenticated double-vote/surround evidence. Its liveness also
   112	depends on the proposal mechanism. PC validity is an additional target
   113	condition in r19, and restricting valid targets preserves the certificate
   114	safety argument. [Casper FFG, §2](https://arxiv.org/html/1710.09437v4)
