   146	All execution times below are in Δ units. Set Δ=16 integer engine ticks,
   147	so every displayed quarter or half is an integer time. Paths arrive before
   148	dependent votes. Own signatures need the stated receipts. Group names are
   149	facts about the run, not cross-label identities available to base code.
