   604	```text
   605	┌──────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐
   606	│ Evidence or control change           │ Maximum new count at fixed m │
   607	├──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤
   608	│ Positive-height J at m−1             │ ε_J                          │
   609	│ Strict aggregate F advances          │ m−1−f0                       │
   610	│ Strict aggregate lower-J advances    │ max(0,m−2−j0)                │
   611	│ Lower-J changes of the filter rule   │ 0                            │
   612	│ Late ≤m witnesses after band settles │ 0 exclusions                 │
   613	│ Initial band/old-cache catch-up      │ 1 settling allowance         │
   614	│ New F/top-J control events for N1    │ N ≤ m−1−f0+ε_J               │
   615	│ Branch-excluding events              │ at most ε_J                  │
   616	└──────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘
   617	```
